  "html": "<p>The shared mythic pile does not dump every name at every level. A mythic will not appear as a quality before 15. After that, later names sit on bands: <b>15 / 35 / 55 / 75 / 95</b>.</p>\n<p>Lair-chest uniques are not on this page. Those are on <a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Lair_Rainbows\" title=\"Boss Lair Rainbows\">Boss Lair Rainbows</a>. Drop odds are on <a href=\"/wiki/Rainbow_Drops\" title=\"Rainbow Drops\">Rainbow Drops</a>.</p>\n<table class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" summary=\"Contents\"><tr><td><div id=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2></div><ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Shared_fighter_armor\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Shared fighter armor</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#How_the_bands_work\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">How the bands work</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Unbanded_older_names\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unbanded older names</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#First_band_from_15_\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">First band (from 15)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Second_band_from_35_\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Second band (from 35)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Third_band_from_55_\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Third band (from 55)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Fourth_band_from_75_\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Fourth band (from 75)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Fifth_band_from_95_\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Fifth band (from 95)</span></a></li>\n</ul></td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Shared_fighter_armor\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Shared fighter armor</span></h2>\n<p>People say fighter rainbow armor for two different piles.</p>\n<p>Plate, scale, splint, and the older named fighter pieces sit in the ordinary armor tables. A lot of those never got a later band, so they can show from 15. Fighters can wear them. They are not the later class set.</p>\n<p>The later dedicated fighter class set is <a href=\"/wiki/Gosh&#x27;s_Shock\" title=\"Gosh&#x27;s Shock\">Gosh&#x27;s Shock</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gosh&#x27;s_Awe\" title=\"Gosh&#x27;s Awe\">Gosh&#x27;s Awe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gosh&#x27;s_Reverence\" title=\"Gosh&#x27;s Reverence\">Gosh&#x27;s Reverence</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gosh&#x27;s_Veneration\" title=\"Gosh&#x27;s Veneration\">Gosh&#x27;s Veneration</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gosh&#x27;s_Wonder\" title=\"Gosh&#x27;s Wonder\">Gosh&#x27;s Wonder</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Gosh&#x27;s_Marvel\" title=\"Gosh&#x27;s Marvel\">Gosh&#x27;s Marvel</a>. That set does not enter the shared drop pool until 35. Before 35 you can still see older fighter-wearable names. You will not see Gosh's Shock.</p>\n<a name=\"How_the_bands_work\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">How the bands work</span></h2>\n<p>Once you hit a band, those names stay in the pile. A 90 is still eligible for the 15 and 35 names. A 20 is not eligible for the 35 set.</p>\n<a name=\"Unbanded_older_names\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Unbanded older names</span></h2>\n<p>These older named pieces never got put on a later band. They can show from 15, same floor as the first band.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Amphisbaena&#x27;s_Double_Dander_Doublet\" title=\"Amphisbaena&#x27;s Double Dander Doublet\">Amphisbaena&#x27;s Double Dander Doublet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Scarab_Ring_of_Extreme_Importance\" title=\"Ancient Scarab Ring of Extreme Importance\">Ancient Scarab Ring of Extreme Importance</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Backwards_Hydraskin_Hat\" title=\"Backwards Hydraskin Hat\">Backwards Hydraskin Hat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Big_Bertha\" title=\"Big Bertha\">Big Bertha</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Quartz\" title=\"Boots of Quartz\">Boots of Quartz</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Buffalo_Bill&#x27;s_Outfit\" title=\"Buffalo Bill&#x27;s Outfit\">Buffalo Bill&#x27;s Outfit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/C.H.U.M.\" title=\"C.H.U.M.\">C.H.U.M.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Celestial_Blade\" title=\"Celestial Blade\">Celestial Blade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Circus_Ring\" title=\"Circus Ring\">Circus Ring</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Contrarian\" title=\"Contrarian\">Contrarian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Crystal_Globe\" title=\"Crystal Globe\">Crystal Globe</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/D&#x27;habl&#x27;u_Ti&#x27;eff\" title=\"D&#x27;habl&#x27;u Ti&#x27;eff\">D&#x27;habl&#x27;u Ti&#x27;eff</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Ring_Around_The_Collar\" title=\"Dark Ring Around The Collar\">Dark Ring Around The Collar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Demon_Sniper\" title=\"Demon Sniper\">Demon Sniper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dialed_In\" title=\"Dialed In\">Dialed In</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Disemboweler\" title=\"Disemboweler\">Disemboweler</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Doc_Wyvern's\" title=\"Doc Wyvern's\">Doc Wyvern's</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fragalot\" title=\"Fragalot\">Fragalot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fuzz_Trimmed_Luv_Cuffs\" title=\"Fuzz Trimmed Luv Cuffs\">Fuzz Trimmed Luv Cuffs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gelphding&#x27;s_Dark_Shards\" title=\"Gelphding&#x27;s Dark Shards\">Gelphding&#x27;s Dark Shards</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Girdle_of_Infinitum\" title=\"Girdle of Infinitum\">Girdle of Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Incrusted_Leviathan_Carapace\" title=\"Incrusted Leviathan Carapace\">Incrusted Leviathan Carapace</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/IRing\" title=\"IRing\">IRing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Jackalope&#x27;s_Visage\" title=\"Jackalope&#x27;s Visage\">Jackalope&#x27;s Visage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lethal_Paws\" title=\"Lethal Paws\">Lethal Paws</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Medusa&#x27;s_Engagement_Ring\" title=\"Medusa&#