 King&#x27;s Memorial Plate</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_King&#x27;s_Mitts\" title=\"The King&#x27;s Mitts\">The King&#x27;s Mitts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Late_Knight&#x27;s_Cap\" title=\"The Late Knight&#x27;s Cap\">The Late Knight&#x27;s Cap</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Late_Knight&#x27;s_Gauntlets\" title=\"The Late Knight&#x27;s Gauntlets\">The Late Knight&#x27;s Gauntlets</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Late_Knight&#x27;s_Grievances\" title=\"The Late Knight&#x27;s Grievances\">The Late Knight&#x27;s Grievances</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Late_Knight&#x27;s_Stacks\" title=\"The Late Knight&#x27;s Stacks\">The Late Knight&#x27;s Stacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Lost_One\" title=\"The Lost One\">The Lost One</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_One_True_Bling\" title=\"The One True Bling\">The One True Bling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Wicked_Barb\" title=\"The Wicked Barb\">The Wicked Barb</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Timrek&#x27;s_Tyranny\" title=\"Timrek&#x27;s Tyranny\">Timrek&#x27;s Tyranny</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ultramarine_Sneaks\" title=\"Ultramarine Sneaks\">Ultramarine Sneaks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vis&#x27;Kar&#x27;s_Bilespitter\" title=\"Vis&#x27;Kar&#x27;s Bilespitter\">Vis&#x27;Kar&#x27;s Bilespitter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wring\" title=\"Wring\">Wring</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ye_Old_Manhole_Cover\" title=\"Ye Old Manhole Cover\">Ye Old Manhole Cover</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Yoke_of_the_Chained_Letter\" title=\"Yoke of the Chained Letter\">Yoke of the Chained Letter</a></li>\n</ul>\n<a name=\"First_band_from_15_\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">First band (from 15)</span></h2>\n<p>Named pieces that sit on the first band. Eligible from 15.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Abracadabras_Fly_Footwear\" title=\"Abracadabras Fly Footwear\">Abracadabras Fly Footwear</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Aggro_Pick\" title=\"Aggro Pick\">Aggro Pick</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ali-Bubba&#x2